    "title": "Vlad and Niki: Kids Piano",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfbc \ud83c\udfb9 \ud83c\udfba Vlad and Niki invite kids and adults to the magical world of music! Boys and girls will learn to play musical instruments and have fun. Toddlers could create their own songs. But we have instruments for all of that. This free musical game is perfectly suitable for kids from 2 till 5 years and older. Vlad and Nikita could learn to play musical instruments and you could do that! Develop the musical talent of all the family members!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 \ud83c\udfb8\ud83e\udd41 Download our app, and you can\u2019t stop playing! There are different sounds and instruments, which turn your device into a real orchestra. Piano, guitar, xylophone and drums \u2013 choose whatever you like. Entertainment and education could be connected because it is very easy to learn musical notes in an easy and bright form. This is the game, that has everything to learn music! Play funny musical games with Vlad and Niki! \ud83d\udc6c",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfbc \ud83c\udfb9 \ud83c\udfba Vlad and Niki invite kids and adults to the magical world of music! Boys and girls will learn to play musical instruments and have fun. Toddlers could create their own songs. But we have instruments for all of that. This free musical game is perfectly suitable for kids from 2 till 5 years and older. Vlad and Nikita could learn to play musical instruments and you could do that! Develop the musical talent of all the family members!<br><br>\ud83c\udfb5 \ud83c\udfb8\ud83e\udd41 Download our app, and you can\u2019t stop playing! There are different sounds and instruments, which turn your device into a real orchestra. Piano, guitar, xylophone and drums \u2013 choose whatever you like. Entertainment and education could be connected because it is very easy to learn musical notes in an easy and bright form. This is the game, that has everything to learn music! Play funny musical games with Vlad and Niki! \ud83d\udc6c",
